## Definition

* Let S be the Sample Space
* Let S be divided into k disjoint events $$ A_1, A_2, A_3...A_k $$ with respective probabilities $$ P(A_1), P(A_2), P(A_3), P(A_3)...P(A_k) $$
* Let B be an event common to all k disjoint events 
